# Enhanced Project Report: Digiverify (Squrify)

## 1. Introduction
**Digiverify** (also known as Squrify) is a high-security, blockchain-integrated land registry and digital verification platform. It solves the critical issues of property fraud and manual overhead by creating an immutable, transparent, and role-based ecosystem for real estate transactions.

> [!IMPORTANT]
> This system uses **ERC-721 NFTs** to represent physical property, ensuring that ownership is digitally unique and cryptographically protected.

