## 3. System Architecture
The system follows a distributed architecture where the backend acts as a bridge between the user interface and the blockchain ledger.

```mermaid
graph TD
    User["User (Buyer/Seller)"] --> Frontend[React UI]
    Frontend --> API[Express API]
    API --> DB[(PostgreSQL)]
    API --> Blockchain{Ethereum Network}
    Blockchain --> LandNFT[LandNFT Contract]
    Blockchain --> SaleWorkflow[SaleWorkflow Contract]
    Authority[Land Authority] --> API
    Bank[Bank Admin] --> API
    Court[Legal Court] --> API
```

## 4. Multi-Signature Sale Workflow
The sale of a property is a complex state-machine governed by both the database and on-chain logic.

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant S as Seller
    participant B as Buyer
    participant BK as Bank
    participant A as Authority
    participant BC as Blockchain

    S->>API: Initiate Sale
    API->>BC: Register On-Chain Sale
    B->>API: Sign Transaction
    API->>BC: Buyer Sign On-Chain
    BK->>API: block-funds (ASBA)
    API->>BC: Confirm Funds On-Chain
    A->>API: Seal of Approval
    API->>BC: executeTransfer
    BC-->>B: NFT Transferred
```

## 5. Technical Deep Dive

### 5.1 Sale State Machine
The `sale_transactions` table implements a strict state machine to prevent race conditions and unauthorized actions.

| Current State | Action | Next State |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `initiated` | Buyer signs | `buyer_signed` |
| `buyer_signed` | Bank confirms block | `funds_blocked` |
| `funds_blocked` | Authority approves | `authority_approved` |
| `authority_approved` | Final Execution | `completed` |

> [!TIP]
> Each transition is validated by the [saleService.js](file:///c:/Users/Akshay/Desktop/Digiverify/backend/services/saleService.js) to ensure that only valid state moves are allowed, preserving data integrity.

### 5.2 Smart Contract Integration
The system interacts with several specialized smart contracts:
- **`LandNFT.sol`**: Manages the minting and metadata of property tokens.
- **`SaleContract.sol`**: Handles the escrow logic, ensuring that NFTs are only transferred when all parties have signed and funds are secured.
- **`CourtOverride.sol`**: Provides a secure "Break Glass" mechanism for legal overrides.

### 5.3 Security & Auditing
- **IPFS Storage**: Documents are hashed and stored decentrally. Changing a single pixel in a document results in a completely different CID, making tampering impossible to hide.
- **Audit Logs**: Every call to the API is logged with the actor's wallet, IP address, and timestamp. These logs are append-only to prevent tampering.

## 6. Conclusion
By integrating **React**, **Node.js**, **PostgreSQL**, and **Ethereum**, Digiverify provides a trustless, transparent, and highly efficient platform for modern land administration. It eliminates the "Trust Gap" between buyers and sellers, making property dealings as simple as sending an email, but as secure as a bank vault.
